        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Sunshine Cottage<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Beautifully situated in a shady grove of coastal greenery, this cozy cottage in Santa Rosa Beach is the perfect place to get away from it all. This comfortable home offers plenty of privacy, a full kitchen, and a shaded patio where you can put your feet up after a day spent on the beach. The expansive outdoor space offers ample seating, a private grill, and even an outdoor shower to cool you off from the Florida sunshine.<br><br><br><br>What's nearby:<br><br>This home sits just north of Scenic Highway 30A, only half a mile from the nearest beach access point. You can walk down to the incredible white sand each morning to play volleyball, sunbathe, or spend the day shore fishing. You'll also be three miles west of Grayton Beach State Park, a beautiful setting for hiking, picnicking, fishing, and wildlife viewing, and three miles east of Gulf Place Town Center, which is home to such area favorites as Pizza By The Sea and YOLO Board + Bike.<br><br><br><br>Things to know:<br><br>Free WiFi<br><br>Full kitchen<br><br>Outdoor shower<br><br>Snowbirds Welcome!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
